<section class="sec-pad" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <h2 class="kicker reveal">About</h2>
    <div>
      <p class="reveal">
        A Bandung-based engineer with 13+ years building backend systems, ERPs, and integrations
        across SaaS, pharma, logistics, and government.
      </p>
      <p class="meta reveal" data-d="80">
        I care about systems that stay reliable under real load — clean APIs, sensible data models,
        and platforms a business can actually run on. Diploma in Informatics Management, Bina Sarana
        Informatika.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 340;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.34;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .about .meta {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
